        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "They told me it was all over."
    },
    {
        "text": "My homeland, my companions, everything buried now."
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
        "key": "$darkness01_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "But I knew, it had only just begun."
    },
    {
        "text": "...And I'm on my way."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_county_1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "04:50 P.M. \\ Overcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "A town in northern Kazimierz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_005",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Here you go. Bread and clean water, all in here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager"
    },
    {
        "text": "Incredible, you are! Fought 'em off, no, wiped 'em out alone, all those gloompincers... Didn't expect one young lady like you'd finish up that job in half an afternoon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even going out all together, the young'uns couldn't handle it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager"
    },
    {
        "text": "Frankly, it gave me a scare, our town being so small. And I've never seen someone fight as ferocious as you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_005",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'll be fine without.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_005",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't want any bread or water? Well... alright, we've got some medicine here too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's from the caravan that passed through last time. We had to trade them a good amount for it. They were worth plenty, I'll tell you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager"
    },
    {
        "text": "By the sights of it, you've been hurt bad, haven't you? You could probably use it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_005",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't need it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_005",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Th-Then what do you need? Gold coins? That'll be tough. We're only a little town, and rabble comes by shaking us down every few days, plus all the beasts making trouble out there...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our pockets are all emptied out by the end of the year. Barely a penny we've got.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_005",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The day before. People sighted a Kuranta the day before, black clothing and a crossbow, heading this way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell me where they are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_005",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Crossbow? The kind you use for hunting?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_005",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The kind to murder.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_005",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "M-Murder?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've got to be joking... no, the look in your eyes says you aren't joking one bit... how frightful... *cough* How could someone like that show up in a little place like ours?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_005",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't screw with me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_005",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I-I-I-I-Is that a weapon? Don't, erm, please don't shoot! I swear, I haven't seen anyone like the person you describe\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_005",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The ones in the last village saw. And told me. They went this way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_005",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Per... perhaps they already passed through here, went south? There's an even bigger town that way, more food, cleaner water...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_005",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, god, Heaven above! Miss, god, believe me, please, I've got no reason to lie to you at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look, please, here, this is the last of my family's money, we were saving it for the year-end tax, this is all we've got, have it, have it all...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_005",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "text": "I said, I don't need it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "text": "Forget it. You can go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Another day, empty-handed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "text": "But no matter. You can't hide much longer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll be following you. All the way\u2014until I find you, one, by one, all of you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
