    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.2,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 60,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What's this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bread, and water. And medicine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "text": "He was scared so bad, he ran off without a trace, and yet he still deliberately came back in after.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is he trying to show thanks? But it was only a few gloompincers, nothing more. It took no effort on my part.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "text": "People like him... do remind me... of back then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Grandpa, who are they? Are they the nice knights everyone talks about?"
    },
    {
        "text": "They aren't...?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are the things they're carrying like the ones the bad people use to pick on us?"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I'm sort of scared."
    },
    {
        "text": "But they're good people, right? They helped us fight off the bad people."
    },
    {
        "text": "I want to say thank you to them."
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't really have any good stuff to give them. Would this half of my scone be okay? I can play a harmonica song for them too."
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm-hm, I hope they can stay with."
    },
    {
        "text": "With all of us, forever."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_coldforest",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Now all that's left is this harmonica.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nice knights? *sigh*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whether then, or now... it's all the same.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "text": "If they're still around... if...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's too bad\u2014there is no 'if.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nervous_intro",
        "key": "$nervous_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_002"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, someone's here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Ruffian"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whoa, and a bunch of food\u2014not much good, but good enough to eat tonight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Ruffian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Leave.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_002",
        "name2": "char_158_milu",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you just tell me to leave? Who do you think you are?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Ruffian"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's just sitting here. Is there a name on it? I don't see you eating it. I found it now, so it's mine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Ruffian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_002",
        "name2": "char_158_milu",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Then just take it and get lost.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_002",
        "name2": "char_158_milu",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait up, what's that you're holding? A harmonica? Heh, some tacky toy. Whatever. Take it to the city, you might find some boring old guy who thinks it's worth something.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Ruffian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_002",
        "name2": "char_158_milu",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "This is not for you to touch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_002",
        "name2": "char_158_milu",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, you talk pretty tough, don't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Ruffian"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who do you even think I am, brat?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Ruffian"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just look at you. How long has it been since you ate something?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Ruffian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_002",
        "name2": "char_158_milu",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.2,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 60,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm warning you\u2014*cough*, *cough* *cough*.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_002",
        "name2": "char_158_milu",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Jeez. You seem pretty sick at that. You'd best believe I could knock you over with a single poke.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Ruffian"
    },
    {
        "text": "What'cha playing at? Don't spook me now, it's dark out here. You think you can threaten anyone with a bare tree branch?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Ruffian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_002",
        "name2": "char_158_milu",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I gave you plenty of warning. You didn't listen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_002",
        "name2": "char_158_milu",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_002"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Ow, ff-ow-ow-ow\u2014that's a crossbow! That's the kind that kills people, isn't it?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Ruffian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get. Lost.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't want to kill anyone tonight. At the very least, not you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_002"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Spare me... bud, just spare me! You can have this, have it all back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Ruffian"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm outta here, I promise!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Ruffian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
