        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$drift_intro",
        "key": "$drift_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "I still haven't found those traitors yet."
    },
    {
        "text": "So long as that day doesn't come, they can never rest in peace\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I can never, ever stop."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hello? Are you okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Seems she hasn't passed out completely... though she's at the point she can't stand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Identity confirmation... yes, just like in the mission description. This should be the target, no mistake.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Serious wounds, fever temperatures, and gravely malnourished... she hasn't eaten properly in forever, and hasn't slept, either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nutritional supplements... and some emergency meds... Lucky I packed enough for the road. Dr. Kal'tsit really sees every last thing coming.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
