        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_coldforest",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 4,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Who are you?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't be alarmed, I mean you no harm. I'm employed by a pharmaceutical company named Rhodes Island. I'm responsible for field work in this area. Here, this is my work ID.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Field Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu"
    },
    {
        "text": "That doesn't prove anything. IDs and papers and whatever can all be forged.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fair enough, they can. Haha, you're just like I heard. An extremely cautious youngster.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Field Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heard? From who?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, jeez, don't get all tense again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Field Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look, I'm serious, I'm not anyone bad. I don't even have any weapons that big or lethal on me. At best, I've got a couple of tools for defending myself from beasts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Field Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've got nothing on you. I see that crossbow of yours... look, it's still right there. You could reach out and grab it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Field Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can we have a real talk now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Field Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you're up to something, you'll regret having stepped into this forest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. I believe you. The crossbow in your hands has already told me that much.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Field Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right now, you need to tell me. Who was it that told you anything about me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's... er...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Field Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's been reports of a very young Elafia girl who's been all around the northern villages of Kazimierz lately, looking for any leads on a specific group. Plenty of people have been picking up on it, actually.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Field Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu"
    },
    {
        "text": "The footprints left behind when tracking prey.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wouldn't have made a mistake like that in the past... but I don't care that I have.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who told you to look for me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "That'd be Rhodes Island. Just like I introduced earlier, Rhodes Island is a pharmaceutical company, doing business in all areas. They've been seeking all sorts of suitable talent, too, and they'd like to invite you to join.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Field Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu"
    },
    {
        "text": "A pharmaceutical company?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you drug me just now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Only some nutritional supplements and a simple first-aid medication. I'm no Medic Operator. I personally can't give you any better of an examination, nor further treatment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Field Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "You look a good bit better now, luckily. Your injuries should be holding decently. If we want any further diagnosis, you'll need to come back to Rhodes Island with me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Field Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "To treat me. And you want to hire me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "text": "Seeing as you've investigated, you should already know. I don't understand the first thing about medicine. The only thing I can do is fight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, what would a pharmaceutical company want a hired bow for?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Er... oh, boy, that one... er, like I said earlier, Rhodes Island does a lot of business, and frequently comes into contact with a lot of different people in a lot of different areas.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Field Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "And during those contacts, we unavoidably run into some emergencies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Field Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "At times like that, we need people with special skills like yours, to help give Rhodes Island a fighting chance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Field Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Whether person or organization, you have to have strength if you want to survive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Right. I'm sure you can understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Field Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But my strength has other uses.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you mean those people you're looking for?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Field Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "text": "Every day I haven't found them is one more day my footsteps will not cease.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand... I'm not too clear about your past, but it's a very common thing, isn't it? Just like us inside Rhodes Island. We've got scores of operators, all with their own differing and individual attachments.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Field Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that so?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We won't ever interfere in an operator's private affairs, and outside of missions, everyone has freedom.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Field Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "Beyond that, when an operator needs it, providing aid doesn't go against our standards, Rhodes Island will provide whatever you want\u2014medical service, crucial information, or necessary strength.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Field Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's why a good few Operators chose to join Rhodes Island, really.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Field Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Then the people I need to find...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can Rhodes Island help me there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not my place to say anything else. Just, us helping you look for someone\u2014that'd be more effective than you going it alone around Kazimierz, or even areas beyond, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Field Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Alone, you probably wouldn't hold out for too long. You're short on supplies, and you don't have any help.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Field Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll be honest, you're not in the best of shape right now. If you need to find someone, accomplish some goal, then first you need to ensure your survival, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Field Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "How do I put it? In our world, if you want to get something done, even if it's as bare and simple as staying alive, a bunch of heads all together always beats one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Field Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Days with no help, only able to rely on myself to live... It's not like I've never gone through times like these.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "text": "(The feeling of someone there to help... I can't deny... day in, day out, I miss it.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "text": "(In that case, this should go a little quicker now.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island... a pharmaceutical company. Not out to do anything bad, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "On that point, you can rest assured.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Field Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright. So long as you're willing to lend me more strength\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can lend my strength to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll join.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's wonderful, then! I won't ask for much more information. Once we get back to Rhodes Island, there'll be HR operators who'll check with you separately.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Field Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "After all the red tape's done with, you can officially become a Rhodes Island Operator.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Field Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think I can say it'll be a delight to work together with, er...? Um, what should I call you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Field Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "...Firewatch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_black",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_158_milu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Past, present, future... no matter where I am.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "text": "Until I find every last traitor, until I fulfill my revenge\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "text": "This will be the only name I possess.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
